      "text": "ing that when he died.  American aviation historians believe he was “years away” from",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.657826279148911,
        "x1": 0.7183268179301343,
        "y1": 0.6729777943004261
      },
      "text": "accomplishing what the Wright Brothers did by building on his work.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1081699296539905,
        "y0": 0.6742399196432094,
        "x1": 0.907564125809015,
        "y1": 0.6893914347947245
      },
      "text": "Nationalism aside, it did take Lilienthal five years of extensive and painstaking experi-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.6906535601375079,
        "x1": 0.9067954019783369,
        "y1": 0.705805075289023
      },
      "text": "mentation to reach the bi-wing glider design, a design he considered feasible for mount-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.7070672006318064,
        "x1": 0.9184837341308594,
        "y1": 0.7222187157833215
      },
      "text": "ing a motor.  Even if he had taken another five to perfect a glider and engine combination,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.7234808411261048,
        "x1": 0.8865660374460657,
        "y1": 0.73863235627762
      },
      "text": "that would still have put his speculative powered flight at 1901, two years ahead of the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.7398944816204033,
        "x1": 0.9094444474363639,
        "y1": 0.7550459967719184
      },
      "text": "Wrights.  However, alternative history is the realm of science fiction writers, and what re-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.7563081221147017,
        "x1": 0.8915816911684922,
        "y1": 0.7714596372662168
      },
      "text": "mains true is that the Wrights were inspired and assisted by Lilienthal’s work.  After all,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.7727217626090002,
        "x1": 0.8861208398357715,
        "y1": 0.7878732777605153
      },
      "text": "they used body shifting to steer their initial gliders, incorporated their take on his wing",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.7891354031032987,
        "x1": 0.9039386175816355,
        "y1": 0.8042869182548138
      },
      "text": "warping design on later models, and put Charles Taylor’s engine on essentially a bi-wing",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.805549043597597,
        "x1": 0.8818680258358226,
        "y1": 0.8207005587491122
      },
      "text": "glider.  On December 17, 1903, they became in America every bit the sensation he had",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.8219626840918955,
        "x1": 0.5140602012085759,
        "y1": 0.8371141992434107
      },
      "text": "been in the relatively new country of Germany.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1081699296539905,
        "y0": 0.8383763245861939,
        "x1": 0.8709150077470766,
        "y1": 0.8535278397377091
      },
      "text": "But, could he have beat them to powered flight?  Quite possibly, but that detracts",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.8547899650804924,
        "x1": 0.8800091462976792,
        "y1": 0.8699414802320076
      },
      "text": "none from the Wrights’ accomplishment.  Rather than competitors, I prefer to think of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.8712036055747909,
        "x1": 0.8948483685262842,
        "y1": 0.8863551207263061
      },
      "text": "them as his heirs and that he might have felt the same about two men who shared with",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07875816494810815,
        "y0": 0.8876172460690893,
        "x1": 0.4686150644339767,
        "y1": 0.9027687612206045
      },
      "text": "him the “indescribable pleasure” of flight.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6933449140561172,
        "y0": 0.9425614747134122,
        "x1": 0.8994658227060356,
        "y1": 0.9606143946599479
      },
      "text": "MARCH/APRIL 2003",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
